## 12. Edge Cases

* Very large video files → compression
* Multiple versions with conflicts
* Teacher has no assigned classes
* Deleted student resources
* Duplicate names → auto-rename
* Offline upload queued
* Students cannot access private folders
* Admin folders read-only

---

## 13. Accessibility

* Large hit targets
* Screen reader friendly resource labels
* Descriptive alt text for thumbnails
* High contrast mode
* Keyboard navigable grid
* Voice search (“Find PDF Quadratic”)

